'' RUN: a graphics GET into a POINTER passes the pointer's value, and a PUT from an ARRAY
'' ELEMENT passes the element's address. GET took the address of the pointer variable and
'' PUT loaded the element, and both wrote or read through garbage. Output identical to
'' fbc-modern's, on a GFX_NULL screen.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/gfx-get-put-ptr.bas -o tests/codegen/gfxgetputptr.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TKO_INCLUDE=toolchains/tiko-windows/inc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/gfxgetputptr.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 8             8              4            32
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: FF0A141E
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: FF0A141E
